    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract interface for vector encoding. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Implementations encode text (queries, passages) into dense vectors suitable for similarity-based retrieval and ranking. Implementations must be thread-safe.</para>
<para>Throws std::runtime_error on initialization or encoding failures. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
